 {page==='opportunities'&&<><PageHeading eyebrow={worker?'GOOD WORK IS OUT THERE':'MAKE ROOM FOR YOUR NEXT BIG IDEA'} title={worker?'Find your next thing.':'Opportunities, meet talent.'} description={worker?'Find work that fits your skills, schedule and ambition.':'Post, manage and connect with the people who fit.'} action={!worker&&<Btn onClick={()=>setEditOpp('new')}><Plus size={17}/> Post opportunity</Btn>}/><div className="filter-bar"><div className="search-box"><Search size={18}/><input aria-label="Search opportunities" placeholder="Try a skill, profession or location…" value={search} onChange={e=>setSearch(e.target.value)}/></div><select aria-label="Opportunity type" value={typeFilter} onChange={e=>setTypeFilter(e.target.value)}><option value="all">All work types</option>{['gig','full_time','part_time','internship'].map(t=><option key={t} value={t}>{label(t)}</option>)}</select>{!worker&&<select aria-label="Opportunity status" value={opportunityStatus} onChange={e=>setOpportunityStatus(e.target.value)}><option value="all">All statuses</option><option value="open">Open</option><option value="closed">Closed</option></select>}{worker&&<label className="check-label"><input type="checkbox" checked={matchOnly} onChange={e=>setMatchOnly(e.target.checked)}/> Matches only</label>}</div><div className="results-heading"><span><strong>{visibleOpps.length}</strong> opportunities to make your move</span><span>FIND YOUR NEXT OPPORTUNITY</span></div><div className="opportunity-grid">{visibleOpps.map((o,i)=><OpportunityCard key={o.id} o={o} index={i} worker={worker} onClick={()=>setOppDetail(o)}/>)}</div>{!visibleOpps.length&&<Empty title="No opportunities fit those filters." body="Try a different skill, location or work type. Your next connection could be one search away." action={<Btn secondary onClick={()=>{setSearch('');setTypeFilter('all');setMatchOnly(false)}}>Clear filters</Btn>}/>}</>}

